[nakli] robot 'arm1' se jud gaye
[nakli] speed set: 0.50
[nakli] arm ghar (home) ja raha hai
[nakli] pose pe ja raha hai: Pose(x=0.100, y=0.200, z=0.300, roll=0.000, pitch=0.000, yaw=0.000)
[nakli] gripper band (pakad raha hai)
[nakli] aage chal raha hai 2.00 meter
[nakli] ghoom raha hai 45.0 degree
[nakli] dhoondh raha hai: 'cube' ... mil gaya
mila: cube 0.91
